WEBVTT

1
00:00:46.416 --> 00:00:47.291
In the previous verses,

2
00:00:47.291 --> 00:00:48.916
Lord Krishna

3
00:00:48.916 --> 00:00:51.541
sang the glories of devotion.

4
00:00:51.541 --> 00:00:54.125
Now in these verses too, the path of devotion's

5
00:00:54.125 --> 00:00:57.833
universal reach He sheds light on.

6
00:00:57.833 --> 00:00:59.625
Lord Krishna explains

7
00:00:59.625 --> 00:01:03.250
that those who are considered
less fortunate in society,

8
00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:06.083
or those for spiritual practice

9
00:01:06.083 --> 00:01:08.750
are thought to have little inclination,

10
00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.625
all of them through devotion

11
00:01:10.625 --> 00:01:13.250
can attain the supreme goal.

12
00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:14.291
Further,

13
00:01:14.291 --> 00:01:17.958
Lord Krishna those born in
favourable circumstances

14
00:01:17.958 --> 00:01:19.833
to engage in devotion

15
00:01:19.833 --> 00:01:22.166
even more encourages.

16
00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:26.708
He reveals the transformative power of devotion.

17
00:01:31.208 --> 00:01:33.375
Lord Krishna's words

18
00:01:33.375 --> 00:01:37.791
of devotion's inclusive nature –
one that brings all along –

19
00:01:37.791 --> 00:01:39.625
and its power to bring auspicious

20
00:01:39.625 --> 00:01:42.416
transformation, He sheds light on.

21
00:01:42.416 --> 00:01:45.083
Regardless of a person's birth or social position,

22
00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:48.500
devotion can purify the heart

23
00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:52.166
and lift the soul to the supreme destination.

24
00:01:52.166 --> 00:01:55.916
He explains that while some social groups,

25
00:01:55.916 --> 00:01:57.416
due to their difficult starting

26
00:01:57.416 --> 00:01:59.416
circumstances, may face greater

27
00:01:59.416 --> 00:02:00.958
social or inner

28
00:02:00.958 --> 00:02:04.166
challenges, but

29
00:02:04.166 --> 00:02:05.208
in the field of devotion

30
00:02:05.208 --> 00:02:07.958
these obstacles are irrelevant.

31
00:02:07.958 --> 00:02:10.791
Devotion is not limited by external qualifications,

32
00:02:10.791 --> 00:02:12.541
but by truth, sincerity,

33
00:02:12.541 --> 00:02:15.291
and love is driven.

34
00:02:15.291 --> 00:02:15.875
Lord Krishna

35
00:02:15.875 --> 00:02:17.958
compares this to karma or jnana

36
00:02:17.958 --> 00:02:20.166
and such other paths,

37
00:02:20.166 --> 00:02:23.250
which on discipline, intellect, and rituals –

38
00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:25.375
meaning religious

39
00:02:25.375 --> 00:02:27.041
adherence to formal

40
00:02:27.041 --> 00:02:29.708
worship – depend on such qualifications.

41
00:02:29.708 --> 00:02:33.250
Yet devotion is beyond these requirements.

42
00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.250
It is accessible to all,

43
00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:39.583
because it is rooted in a
personal relationship with the Lord,

44
00:02:39.583 --> 00:02:40.916
driven by the heart's desire

45
00:02:40.916 --> 00:02:43.708
to serve and love.

46
00:02:43.708 --> 00:02:46.750
Thus, those traditionally considered

47
00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:49.250
of lower caste too through

48
00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:53.500
devotion can spiritually advance.

49
00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.500
Devotion's universality

50
00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:57.500
to further emphasise,

51
00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.750
Lord Krishna assures us

52
00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:02.583
that if from difficult social circumstances

53
00:03:02.583 --> 00:03:04.791
those of disadvantaged backgrounds

54
00:03:04.791 --> 00:03:06.625
can attain liberation,

55
00:03:06.625 --> 00:03:09.500
then how much more easily can those

56
00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:13.791
in favourable circumstances reach the same goal.

57
00:03:13.791 --> 00:03:16.916
He reminds Arjun of the material world's

58
00:03:16.916 --> 00:03:18.250
temporary and unsatisfying

59
00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:20.250
nature

60
00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:22.041
and urges him for the Supreme

61
00:03:22.041 --> 00:03:23.958
to develop eternal love –

62
00:03:23.958 --> 00:03:27.791
on that to focus.

63
00:03:27.791 --> 00:03:30.250
This teaching is not about reinforcing division

64
00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:33.666
or encouraging pessimism,

65
00:03:33.666 --> 00:03:35.750
but about rising above

66
00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:37.875
these tendencies.

67
00:03:37.875 --> 00:03:39.291
Lord Krishna's message

68
00:03:39.291 --> 00:03:40.791
dismantles social

69
00:03:40.791 --> 00:03:42.666
prejudices, declaring

70
00:03:42.666 --> 00:03:45.791
that birth, gender, or social position

71
00:03:45.791 --> 00:03:47.125
do not define any

72
00:03:47.125 --> 00:03:50.583
spiritual capacity.

73
00:03:50.583 --> 00:03:52.916
Lord Krishna's words stand as proof of His

74
00:03:52.916 --> 00:03:56.333
impartial and compassionate nature,

75
00:03:56.333 --> 00:03:59.666
opening the path of devotion to all,

76
00:03:59.666 --> 00:04:03.833
even when their starting
circumstances are adverse.

77
00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:11.416
Life's journey

78
00:04:11.416 --> 00:04:15.916
is sometimes simple, sometimes complex,

79
00:04:15.916 --> 00:04:20.291
but if you are in such moments of life

80
00:04:20.291 --> 00:04:24.791
where no clear solution is visible,

81
00:04:24.791 --> 00:04:27.166
when you ask yourself

82
00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:29.791
this question –

83
00:04:29.791 --> 00:04:33.583
why is life so difficult?

84
00:04:33.583 --> 00:04:35.333
Then remember,

85
00:04:35.333 --> 00:04:38.166
you are not alone.

86
00:04:38.166 --> 00:04:40.333
I am with you.

87
00:04:40.333 --> 00:04:42.958
This world is temporary

88
00:04:42.958 --> 00:04:46.625
and full of anxieties,

89
00:04:46.625 --> 00:04:53.000
and this is an inseparable part of its nature.

90
00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.833
The way forward

91
00:04:54.833 --> 00:04:58.833
is not to find a solution to every problem,

92
00:04:58.833 --> 00:05:01.583
but your consciousness

93
00:05:01.583 --> 00:05:05.000
on a higher level to focus,

94
00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.833
and rise above.

95
00:05:06.833 --> 00:05:12.000
When you immerse your mind in Me,

96
00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:16.375
then to rise above life's problems

97
00:05:16.375 --> 00:05:21.750
indomitable strength and clarity you will receive.

98
00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.625
But this does not mean

99
00:05:23.625 --> 00:05:28.500
that you turn away from your duties,

100
00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:32.291
or look away from reality.

101
00:05:32.291 --> 00:05:35.666
Rather, you must connect.

102
00:05:35.666 --> 00:05:38.500
With the eternal and uplifting

103
00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:42.416
elements – see them.

104
00:05:42.416 --> 00:05:46.375
Problems will come and go,

105
00:05:46.375 --> 00:05:50.250
but they will not be able to shake you,

106
00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:53.250
and within your inner self

107
00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:55.916
you will experience peace.

108
00:05:55.916 --> 00:05:59.875
Remember, life's struggles

109
00:05:59.875 --> 00:06:02.000
never define

110
00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:05.000
your capabilities.

111
00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:08.875
Bring your thoughts toward Me.

112
00:06:08.875 --> 00:06:14.125
I will, even beyond worldly limits,

113
00:06:14.125 --> 00:06:16.250
guide you.

114
00:06:21.083 --> 00:06:24.166
Have you ever thought

115
00:06:24.166 --> 00:06:26.791
how can true spirituality

116
00:06:26.791 --> 00:06:29.333
be limited to any class, caste,

117
00:06:29.333 --> 00:06:33.000
or gender?

118
00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:38.000
In family life and in society, 
false notions of caste, gender,

119
00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.458
or position

120
00:06:40.458 --> 00:06:43.416
often even in spiritual practices

121
00:06:43.416 --> 00:06:47.041
create unnecessary divisions.

122
00:06:47.041 --> 00:06:48.666
But

123
00:06:48.666 --> 00:06:52.708
I assure you,

124
00:06:52.708 --> 00:06:55.375
true spirituality

125
00:06:55.375 --> 00:07:00.625
is entirely beyond these limits.

126
00:07:00.625 --> 00:07:02.000
I

127
00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:08.458
do not discriminate based
on birth or social titles.

128
00:07:08.458 --> 00:07:11.791
I look only at the faith of your heart

129
00:07:11.791 --> 00:07:15.416
and the light of your devotion,

130
00:07:15.416 --> 00:07:17.875
illuminating it.

131
00:07:17.875 --> 00:07:22.625
This same understanding share with your family.

132
00:07:22.625 --> 00:07:24.208
Spirituality

133
00:07:24.208 --> 00:07:28.958
embraces everyone equally.

134
00:07:28.958 --> 00:07:32.875
From the opportunity to connect with Me

135
00:07:32.875 --> 00:07:36.208
no one has been denied.

136
00:07:36.208 --> 00:07:39.666
Whether someone is highly educated

137
00:07:39.666 --> 00:07:43.291
or at the beginning of their spiritual

138
00:07:43.291 --> 00:07:46.666
journey, whether man

139
00:07:46.666 --> 00:07:50.541
or woman or child, every

140
00:07:50.541 --> 00:07:54.958
person has the inherent capacity to progress

141
00:07:54.958 --> 00:07:58.291
in devotion.

142
00:07:58.291 --> 00:08:01.916
In the spiritual sphere, about caste

143
00:08:01.916 --> 00:08:06.208
or other pre-formed notions –

144
00:08:06.208 --> 00:08:09.583
clear away the misconceptions that spread.

145
00:08:09.583 --> 00:08:13.416
Show through your conduct

146
00:08:13.416 --> 00:08:17.875
that love, respect, and equality

147
00:08:17.875 --> 00:08:21.416
are the essence of true spirituality.

148
00:08:21.416 --> 00:08:23.208
When your family

149
00:08:23.208 --> 00:08:28.250
embraces this inclusive vision,

150
00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:31.000
then you create a fragrant

151
00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:34.916
environment where every member

152
00:08:34.916 --> 00:08:40.083
feels themselves valued, and together

153
00:08:40.083 --> 00:08:43.416
is inspired to grow,

154
00:08:43.416 --> 00:08:47.166
because the family is the place

155
00:08:47.166 --> 00:08:51.458
where the divine seed of love is planted,

156
00:08:51.458 --> 00:08:54.375
and society is the field where

157
00:08:54.375 --> 00:08:58.791
it blossoms and flourishes.

158
00:09:03.666 --> 00:09:06.500
In professional life, to attain

159
00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:10.500
success, what is the path?

160
00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:14.125
This question must have come to your mind.

161
00:09:14.125 --> 00:09:16.791
So let Me tell you –

162
00:09:16.791 --> 00:09:21.375
in your professional role, between reality

163
00:09:21.375 --> 00:09:24.041
and encouragement, balance

164
00:09:24.041 --> 00:09:28.166
is what can make you successful,

165
00:09:28.166 --> 00:09:29.916
just as

166
00:09:29.916 --> 00:09:33.958
I do with Arjun.

167
00:09:33.958 --> 00:09:37.708
I describe the temporary

168
00:09:37.708 --> 00:09:40.916
and difficult nature of this world,

169
00:09:40.916 --> 00:09:44.416
but along with it,

170
00:09:44.416 --> 00:09:48.500
toward the inclusive path that brings all along –

171
00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:51.916
that is, My devotion – I also lead.

172
00:09:51.916 --> 00:09:54.750
This approach is a great source

173
00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:57.791
of empowerment.

174
00:09:57.791 --> 00:10:00.500
As a leader,

175
00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:03.416
your organisation, for clarity

176
00:10:03.416 --> 00:10:08.041
and guidance, looks toward you.

177
00:10:08.041 --> 00:10:09.208
So

178
00:10:09.208 --> 00:10:13.000
be clear about those problems

179
00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:16.041
that they may face,

180
00:10:16.041 --> 00:10:20.125
whether it is business uncertainty,

181
00:10:20.125 --> 00:10:25.125
work complexities, or deadlines.

182
00:10:25.125 --> 00:10:27.750
And show them, with a sense of purpose

183
00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:33.875
and hope, the path ahead clearly.

184
00:10:33.875 --> 00:10:36.875
Just as a boatman

185
00:10:36.875 --> 00:10:39.625
even against the direction of the current

186
00:10:39.625 --> 00:10:43.083
takes his boat to its destination,

187
00:10:43.083 --> 00:10:48.458
in the same way true leadership,
even amid problems,

188
00:10:48.458 --> 00:10:51.458
reaches its goal.

189
00:10:51.458 --> 00:10:52.458
When you

190
00:10:52.458 --> 00:10:56.625
a situation's reality acknowledge

191
00:10:56.625 --> 00:11:00.958
while pointing toward a meaningful solution,

192
00:11:00.958 --> 00:11:03.750
then in your team

193
00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:05.291
confidence

194
00:11:05.291 --> 00:11:08.583
and resilience you instil.

195
00:11:08.583 --> 00:11:12.000
Your role is to provide both –

196
00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:16.083
awareness and encouragement.

197
00:11:16.083 --> 00:11:18.541
This balance helps your colleagues

198
00:11:18.541 --> 00:11:20.250
in reality

199
00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:24.416
remain grounded, yet

200
00:11:24.416 --> 00:11:26.875
to rise above problems

201
00:11:26.875 --> 00:11:30.666
it also inspires them, and the leader who

202
00:11:30.666 --> 00:11:34.583
guides with this balance,

203
00:11:34.583 --> 00:11:39.625
in his organisation builds trust, focus, and

204
00:11:39.625 --> 00:11:43.375
an unwavering sense of patience.

205
00:11:43.375 --> 00:11:45.666
Always remember,

206
00:11:45.666 --> 00:11:49.000
through the union of karma and devotion,

207
00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:53.416
you create such a work environment

208
00:11:53.416 --> 00:11:56.583
where all, performing the best actions,

209
00:11:56.583 --> 00:12:00.625
move toward spiritual progress.
